# NEXUS // Creative Cortex — environment variables
#
# Nothing here is required. Copy to .env.local and adjust only if you serve the
# build from somewhere other than the defaults.

# Asset base path override.
#   - production builds default to the GitHub Pages sub-path /CREATIVE-CORTEX-V4.1/
#   - dev defaults to /
# Set to "/" to build/serve from a domain root (e.g. a custom domain or the
# sandbox live preview):
# VITE_BASE=/
